# Documentation standards

## Functions

Every function (especially exported and class methods) must have JSDoc describing **what it does**, parameters, and return value when non-obvious.

## Classes

Every class must have JSDoc describing **its responsibility** in the system (e.g. "Orchestrates supply chain lifecycle business rules").

## Interfaces / types / schemas

Document **each key** with a brief description of meaning and constraints.

```typescript
/** Supply chain aggregate root for traceability journeys. */
export interface ISupplyChain {
  /** Human-readable chain name shown in the UI. */
  name: string;
  /** Unique business code (uppercase slug). */
  code: string;
}
```

## Zod schemas

Add `.describe()` on fields or a block comment above the schema explaining the shape.
